# prof.inp.903 - driver-restart regression test. Column order actually read by modstartup::readinitfiles is height thl qt u v e12 (not the "zf u v thl qt e12" a header might suggest -- see make_case_fixtures.py write_profiles). thl=288K, not 0: modthermodynamics::fromztop does not divide by a zero virtual potential temperature.
